+// Package fixtries reads and writes a subject's fix-tries file.
+//
+// The file records, in the subject's adopt scratch directory, how many fix tasks the subject's check has filed.
+// Adopt's fix loop, its green clear and `ResetTries`, and the upgrade's first read call it.
+// The caller hands in the subject's directory; the package derives no path of its own.
+//
+// It imports only `internal/state`, so a package that adopt itself imports can read the count without importing adopt.
+package fixtries
